All orders with minions before spells achieve 100% win rate. The key constraint is that Sanguine Refiner (A) must be played before the Blood Gem spells (C and D) so its Rally buff applies.

Dune Dweller (B) has no Blood Gem interaction, so its position relative to A doesn't matter. Between the two 100% options, ABCD is the canonical ordering.

