The Fleshling at 7/9 survives Broodmother's first hit (7 damage, killing its Divine Shield via Rally) and can then trade favourably, protecting the rest of the warband. Buffing Shark or Trapper leaves the fragile Fleshling to die immediately to the Broodmother's opening attack.

