The results are clear: giving Divine Shield to Wildfire Elemental (position 3) yields the best results — highest win rate (52.7%) and lowest expected damage (1.82).

This makes strategic sense: Wildfire Elemental is your primary damage dealer (6 attack) but very fragile (3 health). It can trade into most enemy minions, but the key threat is Deadly Spore (Venomous), which would destroy it on contact. Divine Shield both protects it from Venomous and lets it survive combat to trigger its Excess damage effect on adjacent enemies.

